# Audi A4 B8 four-door saloon, 2008-2015.
#
# The B8: 4,703 mm long, 1,826 mm wide, 1,427 mm high, 2,808 mm wheelbase; the
# longest A4 yet, with the engines moved back for balance. 1.8-3.0 petrol and
# 2.0/3.0 TDI; facelift in 2011. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audi_A4
#
# Colours: Brilliant Black, Ice Silver, Deep Sea Blue and Dakota Grey are period
# Audi finishes.
#
# Weight: 250 in total (black 75, silver 75, blue 55, grey 45).
#
# Speed 230 km/h; comfort 130/375 (line). Classes 2,3.
# Dates: 2008-2015 with a road tail to about 2025.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/audi-a4-b8.blend. References:
# citycars/references/audi-a4-b8/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

